{"type":"message","id":"99de98df","parentId":"ef6764c3","timestamp":"2026-04-18T05:43:21.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n命令执行没找到已安装的微信相关技能，那我应该先询问用户具体安装的是什么微信插件，或者让用户提供更多信息？不对，也可能是安装的插件名不带wechat关键词？或者用户记错了？我可以先列出所有已安装的技能看看，或者直接问用户之前安装的微信插件叫什么名字，或者直接让用户执行添加账户的命令试试？\n\n不对，先试试列出所有已安装的技能，看看有没有微信相关的，可能名字是拼音weixin？","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0zfs3dvete95fokgobk9688u","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw skills list | grep -i \"weixin\\|微信\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776490994369,"responseId":"021776490995257b2d574b8a133720ef9fae8eba78adee9355b73"}}
