{"type":"message","id":"e8c2ae90","parentId":"79c80014","timestamp":"2026-04-18T05:59:33.123Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户现在给我展示了一段nvidia的配置内容，问我是否需要这样添加到配置文件中。看起来用户想要把nvidia的配置添加到`models.providers.nvidia`这个位置。\n\n让我理解一下：用户之前问\"你给我添加的nvidia模型呢，我怎么在配置文件里找不到\"，我解释说不需要手动添加，因为插件会自动管理。但用户现在展示了nvidia的完整配置块，问是否需要这样添加。\n\n我应该帮用户把这段配置添加到`openclaw.json`的`models.providers.nvidia`位置。需要：\n1. 读取当前的openclaw.json\n2. 在`models.providers`中添加nvidia配置块\n3. 写回文件\n\n让我用edit工具来精确地添加这个配置。我需要在`\"models\": {\"providers\": {`部分添加nvidia配置。\n\n先看看当前的配置，`models.providers`部分有：\n- minimax\n- zai\n- google\n- openrouter\n- volcengine-plan\n\n我需要在providers部分添加nvidia配置。使用edit工具来完成这个操作。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你说得对！确实需要把这个配置块添加到 `models.providers` 中。我之前误解了配置方式。让我帮你添加这个完整的 NVIDIA 配置："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3kdw90391wwxlappd1aiomwr","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json","edits":[{"oldText":"  \"models\": {\n    \"mode\": \"merge\",\n    \"providers\": {\n      \"minimax\": {","newText":"  \"models\": {\n    \"mode\": \"merge\",\n    \"providers\""}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776491949331,"responseId":"021776491949881b2d574b8a133720ef9fae8eba78adee9eec726"}}
