{"type":"message","id":"74a5478f","parentId":"f6f6526d","timestamp":"2026-04-18T06:06:48.409Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"很好！NVIDIA 配置已经成功添加到 `models.providers` 中了。现在验证一下配置是否完整：\n\n1. ✅ NVIDIA API KEY 已在环境中（通过 export 命令设置）\n2. ✅ NVIDIA 配置块已添加到 `models.providers` 中\n3. ✅ 包含了两个模型：minimaxai/minimax-m2.7 和 google/gemma-3n-e4b-it\n4. ✅ NVIDIA 插件已在 plugins 中启用\n5. ✅ 模型已在 `agents.defaults.models` 中列出\n6. ✅ 默认模型已设置为 nvidia/google/gemma-3n-e4b-it\n\n配置完成！现在我需要告诉用户配置已经正确添加了。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **配置完成！** 你说得对，确实需要在 `models.providers` 中添加完整的 NVIDIA 配置块。\n\n## 已添加的配置：\n\n### 1. NVIDIA API KEY\n```bash\nNVIDIA_API_KEY 已在环境中设置\n```\n\n### 2. NVIDIA Provider 配置\n已成功添加到 `models.providers` 中：\n```json\n\"nvidia\": {\n  \"baseUrl\": \"https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1\",\n  \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n  \"models\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7\",\n      \"name\": \"MiniMax M2.7\",\n      \"reasoning\": true,\n      \"input\": [\"text\"],\n      \"contextWindow\": 200000,\n      \"maxTokens\": 8192\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"google/gemma-3n-e4b-it\",\n      \"name\": \"Google Gemma 3N E4B IT\",\n      \"reasoning\": true,\n      \"input\": [\"text\", \"image\", \"audio\"],\n      \"contextWindow\": 32768,\n      \"maxTokens\": 32768\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 验证配置\n你可以运行以下命令验证：\n\n```bash\n# 查看所有可用模型（应该能看到 NVIDIA 模型）\nopenclaw models list\n\n# 测试连接和模型可用性\nopenclaw models test nvidia/minimaxai/minimax-m2.7\n```\n\n现在 NVIDIA 模型配置已经完整了，可以在配置文件中找到这些模型定义。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776492379698,"responseId":"021776492380247b2d574b8a133720ef9fae8eba78adee9c00b7e"}}
